:: MP Region Clockwork Undercity [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_corridor"] to 1>>
顺着高街钟塔基座下方的石阶深入地底，一座维多利亚式的青铜机括空间展现在眼前。巨型齿轮沿着拱顶缓缓啮合，脚下的铸铁格栅传来低沉的机械震颤。
<<if $science gte 260 or $maths gte 260>>你借着煤气壁灯看清了主传动轴的转向，稳稳踏上检修平台。<<else>>错综复杂的铜管与轰鸣声让你一时难以分清深处的布局。<</if>>
<<if ($tiredness or 0) gte 800>>地底温热的蒸汽与规律的擒纵声交织在一起，让你略微疲惫的眼皮有些发沉。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:10)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[前往齿轮回廊 (0:05)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpMicroNotice and $mpMicroNotice["clockwork_oil"]>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[去三号轴看滴油铜杯 (0:04)|MP Region Micro Clockwork Oil]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[观察管线走向 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[向检修学徒打听 (0:05)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Undercity Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你扶着温热的黄铜栏杆俯身，顺着铸铁格栅下的导轨辨认通路。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回去 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-clockwork-undercity-scout">
<<investigateicon>><<link "摸查管廊阀门 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-undercity-scout">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["clockwork_steam"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>>你顺着紫铜副管摸到一扇检修门，<span class="green">发现了通往蒸汽压力室的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_astro"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往停摆天文台的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_vault"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往档案馆密库的路径。</span>
	<<else>>你把四周暗径复查了一遍，<span class="teal">没有新的异动。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	滚烫蒸汽突然从泄压阀喷出，惊得你连忙缩手，<span class="red">只能先行退回。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link "攀上吊轨横梁 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-undercity-scout">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["clockwork_vault"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>>你从高处横梁看清了齿轮后方的暗廊，<span class="green">锁定了档案馆密库的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_astro"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了停摆天文台的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_steam"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了蒸汽压力室的入口。</span>
	<<else>>高处视野开阔，<span class="teal">各处小径都已了然于胸。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	横梁满是滑腻机油，你差点踩空跌落，<span class="red">没敢再往深处迈步。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Clockwork Undercity Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
油杯立柱旁站着拎铜壶的检修学徒，你上前打听地底门道。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回去 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-clockwork-undercity-ask">
<<link "轻声向学徒请教 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-undercity-ask">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["clockwork_steam"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>>学徒擦了擦汗，指了指侧方通道：<span class="green">告诉了你蒸汽压力室的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_astro"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你停摆天文台的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_vault"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你档案馆密库的走法。</span>
	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说这儿的门道你已经全熟了。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	学徒赶着去添机油，摇手让你别挡路，<span class="red">让你碰了一鼻子灰。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "报出钟表铺编号 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-undercity-ask">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["clockwork_astro"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>>学徒认出塞拉的修表暗号，低声透露：<span class="green">为你指明了停摆天文台的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_vault"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了档案馆密库的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_steam"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了蒸汽压力室的暗径。</span>
	<<else>>对方冲你点点头，<span class="teal">提醒你里头一切照旧。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你报错了齿号，学徒狐疑地退后半步，<span class="red">只让你老实在外头待着。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Clockwork Corridor [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_corridor"] to 1>>
两侧石壁嵌满了缓慢转动的黄铜从动轮，地面铺着防滑的铸铁格栅。每过三秒，两米高的主擒纵叉便发出一声清脆的金属咬合声。
<<if $science gte 250 or $athletics gte 250>>你踩着擒纵轮停顿的节拍穿行，避开了甩出机油的轴承。<<else>>飞转的齿轮近在咫尺，震得你耳膜嗡嗡作响。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿铁梯退回机括城口 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿机油痕去压力室 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[俯身查看检修槽 (0:09)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor Search]]>><<pass 9>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[靠回廊石柱旁歇息 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "数擒纵咬合声 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-clockwork-corridor">>
<<if $science gte 250 or $maths gte 250>>
你数准主擒纵叉每三秒一次的停顿，发现轴承旁有一道新上的机油痕，顺着它能看到蒸汽压力室的检修门。
<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>>
<<else>>
齿轮的咬合声密得像雨点，你数到一半就乱了拍子，只觉耳膜发胀。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-clockwork-corridor"></div>
<br>
<<link [[查看从动轮卡齿火星 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Corridor Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你半跪在齿轮回廊主传动轴旁，看准大齿轮转过缺口的瞬间将手探入检修槽。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回齿轮回廊 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="clockwork-corridor-choices">
<<investigateicon>><<link "摸主轴检修槽 (0:09)">><<pass 9>><<replace "#clockwork-corridor-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 330>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Clockwork_Corridor")>>
		你趁大齿轮转过缺口的瞬间勾出绒布匣：一枚精密擒纵轮、半枚王冠齿轮残片和一张工坊收据。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_clockwork_corridor>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_clockwork_corridor to 1>>
			你用铁钩从排油槽滤网上挑起一只油纸包，里面是两枚机工藏起的银币和一小截刻着编号的铜丝。<span class="green">你把找到的物件妥善收好。</span>
			<<money 200>><<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">排油槽滤网今日已被你挑检过，只余下温热的润滑油渍。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	从动轮突然加速回咬，滚烫的润滑油溅在手背上，你猛地抽手后退，槽底的东西没摸到。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "读检修铭牌 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#clockwork-corridor-choices">>
<<if $science gte 260 or $maths gte 260>>
	<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>>
	你顺着铭牌上的红色箭头读出管线走向，确认西侧阀门通道通向蒸汽压力室。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	铭牌被油泥糊住大半，你只认出几个互相矛盾的箭头。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Clockwork Corridor Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
你退到齿轮回廊拐角恒温的铸铁护栏边坐下，背靠着干燥的石柱。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[起身回齿轮回廊 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-clockwork-corridor-rest-choices">
<<tendingicon>><<link "贴着恒温护栏暖背 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-corridor-rest-choices">>
<<if $willpower gte 430 or $science gte 250>>
规律沉稳的擒纵摆动声渐渐与你的心跳重合，<span class="green">地底恒温的暖气烘干了衣角潮意。你紧绷的神经安定下来。</span>
<<tiredness -4>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
刺耳的金属摩擦声在耳边反复回荡，震得脚底铁栅微微发麻。你捂着耳朵坐了一会儿，<span class="red">只觉得太阳穴隐隐作痛。</span>
<<stress 4>><<pain 1>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
