<<link "擦去鞋底沾的机油 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-corridor-rest-choices">>
你在防滑铁格栅边缘刮净鞋底机油，<span class="teal">借着地底恒温暖意歇了歇腿。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Clockwork Steam [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>>
粗大的紫铜管道在拱室中央交汇，水银压力表的指针随着白雾喷吐轻轻颤动。空气里弥漫着温热的黄铜与冷凝水气息。
<<if $science gte 280 or $physique gte 11500>>你避开正在泄压的法兰气口，沿着干燥的检修铁廊稳步前行。<<else>>闷热的蒸汽扑面而来，熏得你额头沁出一层细汗。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿铁廊退回机括城口 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿干管去天文台 (0:10)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[靠近备用冷凝管 (0:10)|MP Region Clockwork Steam Search]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[去隔热铜管边暖手 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Steam Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看压力表回摆 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-clockwork-steam">>
<<if $science gte 280 or $physique gte 11500>>
你盯住水银柱的细微回摆，判断出备用管正在缓慢泄压；管壁上的粉笔箭头指向停摆天文台。
<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>>
<<else>>
白雾糊住表盘，你只看见指针在红线附近乱颤，不敢贸然靠近。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-clockwork-steam"></div>

:: MP Region Clockwork Steam Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你握住扳手凑近备用冷凝管的盲端法兰盖，屏住呼吸逆时针发力旋动螺栓。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回蒸汽压力室 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="clockwork-steam-choices">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拧盲端法兰 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#clockwork-steam-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 360>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Clockwork_Steam")>>
		你卸下法兰盖，从干燥管腔里抽出一卷黄铜蓝图和半枚王冠齿轮残片；图纸筒底还塞着约 £4 的工程备用金。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money 400>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_clockwork_steam>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_clockwork_steam to 1>>
			你从仪表墙后的锡盒里翻出两枚封装完好的旧银元和一张标着“天文台”的管线草图。<span class="green">你把找到的物件妥善收好。</span>
			<<money 200>><<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">仪表墙后的锡盒今日已被你翻过，里面只剩几圈旧垫片。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	法兰接缝里窜出一股滚烫余压，灼得手指剧痛，扳手也砸在脚背上。你只好退回来。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "对照管线图 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#clockwork-steam-choices">>
<<if $science gte 280 or $maths gte 260>>
	<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>>
	你把冷凝水痕和管线图对上，找到了通往停摆天文台的升降暗门。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	图上的管线交叉太多，你看了半天仍不敢确定哪一根通往上层。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Clockwork Steam Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
你挑了一段包着隔热石棉布的副蒸汽管旁坐下，借着温热的气流烘烤微凉的指尖。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先退回去 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-clockwork-steam-rest-choices">
