<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Clockwork Astro [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>>
地底穹顶下悬挂着一座靠发条驱动的黄铜天球仪，镶嵌在圆环上的荧光石映射着地面星轨。四周石桌上散落着半打磨好的水晶透镜。
<<if $maths gte 280 or $history gte 280>>你认出了浑天仪基座上的黄道十二宫刻度。<<else>>繁复交错的星轨铜环让你看得眼花缭乱。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿铁旋梯退回机括城口 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿配重井去密库 (0:12)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[检查浑天仪底座 (0:13)|MP Region Clockwork Astro Search]]>><<pass 13>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[坐真皮观测椅小憩 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Astro Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "对黄道刻度 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-clockwork-astro">>
<<if $maths gte 280 or $history gte 280>>
你发现天蝎座刻度被反复摩挲得发亮，底座侧面还有一道新添划痕，正对着档案馆密库的防爆门方向。
<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>>
<<else>>
黄道铜环层层叠叠，你看得眼花，没能记住哪一格被动过。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
