:: MP Region Clockwork Vault [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>>
由多重机械字码锁守护的干燥石库内，整齐排列着编号从 A 到 M 的黑铁卷宗柜。最里侧的石台上摆着一台老式黄铜差分机，空气干燥而冷冽。
<<if $maths gte 300 or $skulduggery gte 320>>你一眼看出了卷宗柜底座滑轨的开启顺序。<<else>>厚重的防爆铁门与成排的密码锁透着森严的压迫感。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿防爆门退回机括城口 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[细看十二号卷宗柜 (0:14)|MP Region Clockwork Vault Search]]>><<pass 14>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[坐密库矮凳上调息 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Vault Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查验十二号柜后暗门 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看柜脚滑轨 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-clockwork-vault">>
<<if $maths gte 300 or $skulduggery gte 320>>
你注意到 A 到 M 号柜的滑轨磨损并不均匀，十二号柜底座有一道被反复拉开的亮痕。
<<else>>
铁柜底座积着厚灰，你只看见一排差不多的滑轨，分不出哪只常被打开。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-clockwork-vault"></div>

:: MP Region Clockwork Vault Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
