	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[辨认石廊痕迹 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[向守墓苦修打听 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你举起石龛残灯，顺着断壁浮雕与地面刮痕仔细摸索。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回修道院外庭 (0:02)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
