<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["abbey_confess"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_confess"] to 1>>你拨开枯藤发现一道石拱侧门，<span class="green">发现了通往告解回音壁的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往灰烬藏经阁的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["abbey_ferry"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_ferry"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往地下暗河渡口的路径。</span>
	<<else>>你把四周暗径复查了一遍，<span class="teal">没有新的异动。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	枯藤后的碎石坍落砸在脚背上，<span class="red">只能先行退回。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link "登上残破钟廊眺望 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-sunken-abbey-scout">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["abbey_ferry"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_ferry"] to 1>>你从残廊高处看清了地底水声的来向，<span class="green">锁定了地下暗河渡口的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了灰烬藏经阁的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["abbey_confess"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_confess"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了告解回音壁的入口。</span>
	<<else>>高处视野开阔，<span class="teal">各处小径都已了然于胸。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	残廊石阶松动摇晃，你只得退回地面，<span class="red">没敢再往深处迈步。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
柱廊阴影下立着添香油的守墓苦修士，你上前请教古修道院格局。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[告别苦修回外庭 (0:02)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
