<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["abbey_confess"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_confess"] to 1>>苦修士合十低语，指了指石阶深处：<span class="green">告诉了你告解回音壁的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你灰烬藏经阁的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["abbey_ferry"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_ferry"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你地下暗河渡口的走法。</span>
	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说这儿的门道你已经全熟了。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	苦修士闭目诵经不予理会，<span class="red">让你碰了一鼻子灰。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "背诵古圣咏尾句 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-sunken-abbey-ask">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"] to 1>>苦修士听出古教团祝词，侧身指路：<span class="green">为你指明了灰烬藏经阁的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["abbey_ferry"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_ferry"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了地下暗河渡口的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["abbey_confess"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_confess"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了告解回音壁的暗径。</span>
	<<else>>对方冲你点点头，<span class="teal">提醒你里头一切照旧。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你念错了音节，苦修士冷淡地请你就此止步，<span class="red">只让你老实在外头待着。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

