:: MP Region Abbey Ferry Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>>
你跨进停泊在石阶边的平底柏木舟，靠着干燥的船舱木板坐下歇息。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[起身回暗河渡口 (0:02)|MP Region Abbey Ferry]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-abbey-ferry-rest-choices">
<<tendingicon>><<link "靠着干燥船板伸腿 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-abbey-ferry-rest-choices">>
<<if $swimmingskill gte 240 or $willpower gte 440>>
木舟随着平缓的暗河水流轻轻摇晃，潺潺水声洗去了你脑海中的杂念，<span class="green">四肢的酸软感渐渐消退。</span>
<<tiredness -4>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
河道深处忽然涌来一排暗浪，震得木舟撞在系船石桩上咚咚作响，<span class="red">晃得你胃里一阵翻腾。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拢好被水汽打湿的发 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-abbey-ferry-rest-choices">>
你将水汽打湿的碎发拢到耳后，<span class="teal">听着柏木舟下的轻柔水声歇息片刻。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Glasshouse Manor [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_orchid"] to 1>>
推开冬青树篱后方的铸铁雕花小门，巨大的弧形玻璃穹顶与锻铁骨架笼罩着整座秘密温室。恒温水雾在藤架间升腾，空气里浮动着清甜的兰草香气。
<<if $tending gte 260 or $science gte 260>>你顺着铜制喷淋管的走向望去，立刻摸清了前厅的园艺分区。<<else>>浓郁的花香与温润白雾交织在一起，遮住了温室深处的长廊。<</if>>
<<if Weather.isFreezing>>穹顶外的寒霜与室内的温润兰香隔着一层玻璃，铜管壁上凝结着细密的水珠。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[前往雾化兰花厅 (0:06)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpMicroNotice and $mpMicroNotice["glasshouse_nozzle"]>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[去北藤架疏通喷淋嘴 (0:04)|MP Region Micro Glasshouse Nozzle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查看花房水路 (0:06)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[向守夜园丁打听 (0:05)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Region Glasshouse Manor Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你拨开垂落的蕨叶，顺着大理石排水槽与铁艺隔门往内查探。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回温室门厅 (0:02)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-glasshouse-manor-scout">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拨开蕨丛寻暗门 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-glasshouse-manor-scout">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"]>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"] to 1>>你在藤架后寻见一扇雕花铜门，<span class="green">发现了通往夜光标本廊的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"]>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往玻璃穹顶露台的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"]>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往地下酿造室的路径。</span>
	<<else>>你把四周暗径复查了一遍，<span class="teal">没有新的异动。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	带刺蔷薇刮破了你的手背，<span class="red">只能先行退回。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link "顺铁艺旋梯登高 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-glasshouse-manor-scout">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"]>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"] to 1>>你登高俯瞰看清了温室深处的通道，<span class="green">锁定了地下酿造室的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"]>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了玻璃穹顶露台的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"]>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了夜光标本廊的入口。</span>
	<<else>>高处视野开阔，<span class="teal">各处小径都已了然于胸。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	湿滑铁梯让你脚底打滑，<span class="red">没敢再往深处迈步。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Glasshouse Manor Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
温床边站着修剪兰花气根的守夜园丁，你上前打听花房格局。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[告别园丁回门厅 (0:02)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-glasshouse-manor-ask">
<<link "微笑向园丁问路 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-glasshouse-manor-ask">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"]>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"] to 1>>园丁放下花剪，善意地指了指内侧：<span class="green">告诉了你夜光标本廊的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"]>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你玻璃穹顶露台的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"]>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你地下酿造室的走法。</span>
	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说这儿的门道你已经全熟了。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	园丁怕担责，摆手让你只在前厅走动，<span class="red">让你碰了一鼻子灰。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "提起罕见兰花学名 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-glasshouse-manor-ask">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"]>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"] to 1>>园丁惊讶于你的草木学识，主动指点：<span class="green">为你指明了玻璃穹顶露台的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"]>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了地下酿造室的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"]>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了夜光标本廊的暗径。</span>
	<<else>>对方冲你点点头，<span class="teal">提醒你里头一切照旧。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你说错了育种年份，园丁催你快些离开，<span class="red">只让你老实在外头待着。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Glasshouse Orchid [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_orchid"] to 1>>
温暖湿润的玻璃厅堂内，数十种罕见的夜光银脉兰在锻铁藤架间吐露芳华。恒温铜管每隔片刻便喷出一缕细腻的水雾，石板地面光洁温润。
<<if $tending gte 260 or $beauty gte 3500>>你轻巧地避开垂落的气根，没有惊扰花瓣上的露珠。<<else>>馥郁甜美的花香萦绕在呼吸间，让你脸颊微微发热。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿花径退回温室口 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[穿花架去标本廊 (0:07)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[蹲看花坛排水格 (0:10)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid Search]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[坐铁艺长椅上歇脚 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看兰花气根 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-glasshouse-orchid">>
<<if $tending gte 260 or $science gte 260>>
你发现靠东墙的银脉兰气根都朝同一条磨砂玻璃缝伸展，缝后隐约有标本瓶的幽蓝反光。
<<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"] to 1>>
<<else>>
甜香熏得人发困，你只看见一片晃动的气根，没辨出风向。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-glasshouse-orchid"></div>
<br>
<<link [[查看缠住百叶窗的常春藤 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Glasshouse Orchid Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你蹲在大理石花坛背阴侧，伸手探向覆着白石英砂的排水暗格。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回雾化兰花厅 (0:02)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="glasshouse-orchid-choices">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拨花坛暗格 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#glasshouse-orchid-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"] to 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Glasshouse_Orchid")>>
		你拨开石英砂取出密封锦盒：一只古董玉瓶、一朵双生银丝花标本和一枚沙龙赏金银币。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragBrideFlower to ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_glasshouse_orchid>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_glasshouse_orchid to 1>>
			你在花神像倾斜的底座下摸出两枚宾客遗落的银币和一张写着“标本廊”的铜牌。<span class="green">你把找到的物件妥善收好。</span>
			<<money 200>><<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">花神像底座今日已被你探过，只剩湿润的白石英砂。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	花架上的血色猪笼草突然倾倒，粘稠液滴和花刺一起落在手背上。你连忙缩手退开。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "比对兰花标签 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#glasshouse-orchid-choices">>
<<if $tending gte 260 or $science gte 260>>
	<<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"] to 1>>
	你读出一张标签背面的育种编号，和夜光标本廊门牌上的编号只差一位。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	标签被水雾泡得发白，你只看清半个拉丁学名。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

