	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Glasshouse Specimen Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>>
你倚在散发着淡淡木香的胡桃木长柜旁，望着瓶中柔和的幽蓝荧光静心调息。
