<<link "活动僵硬的肩颈 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-glasshouse-specimen-rest-choices">>
你倚着温润的胡桃木柜框转了转肩膀，<span class="teal">幽蓝微光让紧绷的心神安定不少。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Glasshouse Dome [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"] to 1>>
顺着铁艺旋梯登上二层环形露台，弧形玻璃穹顶将外面的天光云影尽收眼底。雕花围栏边摆着藤编茶几，悬空花槽里种满了垂吊迷迭香。
<<if $athletics gte 260 or $tending gte 260>>你扶着铸铁栏杆稳步走上露台，清新的迷迭香气令人精神一振。<<else>>悬挑在半空的铁栅步道微微颤动，让你不由得放慢了脚步。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿旋梯退回温室口 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿暗梯下酿造室 (0:09)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar]]>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[攀上旋梯顶端 (0:12)|MP Region Glasshouse Dome Search]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[窝进藤编躺椅养神 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Dome Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看风向标偏角 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-glasshouse-dome">>
<<if $athletics gte 260 or $tending gte 260>>
你发现风向标底座的铜轴被磨出一圈亮痕，旁边地砖有一道常被掀开的缝，下面透出地窖的酒气。
<<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"] to 1>>
<<else>>
高空的风把衣角吹得猎猎作响，你只顾扶栏杆，没细看风向标。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-glasshouse-dome"></div>

