:: MP Region Blackiron Yard Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你压低身形沿着道岔扳手摸索，借龙门吊阴影观察停靠的车皮。
