<<investigateicon>><<link "贴着闷罐车摸进 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-yard-scout">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["blackiron_armored"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_armored"] to 1>>你顺着枕木油迹摸到隐蔽栈道，<span class="green">发现了通往三号装甲货车的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_signal"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_signal"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往信号塔值班室的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_platform"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往地下走私月台的路径。</span>
	<<else>>你把四周暗径复查了一遍，<span class="teal">没有新的异动。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	碎煤渣滑落惊动了巡夜犬，<span class="red">只能先行退回。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link "爬上龙门吊铁梯 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-yard-scout">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["blackiron_platform"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"] to 1>>你从铁梯高处看清了场站深处的灯火，<span class="green">锁定了地下走私月台的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_signal"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_signal"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了信号塔值班室的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_armored"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_armored"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了三号装甲货车的入口。</span>
	<<else>>高处视野开阔，<span class="teal">各处小径都已了然于胸。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	铁梯满是冰霜，冻僵的手指险些抓空，<span class="red">没敢再往深处迈步。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

