	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说这儿的门道你已经全熟了。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	老工敲了敲铁轨让你别乱闯重地，<span class="red">让你碰了一鼻子灰。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "递上防风火柴套话 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-yard-ask">>
