<div id="obs-blackiron-platform"></div>
<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_blackiron_medal"]>><br><<keepsakeicon>><<link [[插入黑铁货运徽章 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Region Blackiron Platform Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你绕到地下走私月台的起重滑轮后方，伸手撬动配重铁箱侧面的活扣。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回地下装卸台 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="blackiron-platform-choices">
<<investigateicon>><<link "撬配重铁箱 (0:14)">><<pass 14>><<replace "#blackiron-platform-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 410>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Blackiron_Platform")>>
		你稳住滑轮铁索掀开箱盖，取出未拆封的古董货包和半枚孤儿院账册密匙；夹层里还有约 £5 的走私分红。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragLedgerKey or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragLedgerKey to ($mpFragLedgerKey or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money 500>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_blackiron_platform>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_blackiron_platform to 1>>
			你在樟木货箱底部的防潮袋里摸出两枚暗市银元和一张写着“账册在城里”的油纸。<span class="green">你把找到的物件妥善收好。</span>
			<<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">樟木货箱底部的防潮袋今日已被你翻过，只余下干燥木屑。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	起重滑轮铁链猛地滑脱一寸，配重铁箱重重磕在石台上，夹伤手指。你忍痛退到立柱后。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "听水闸铜钟 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#blackiron-platform-choices">>
<<if $athletics gte 280 or $swimmingskill gte 240>>
	你数准暗浪撞钟的间隔，在两次钟声之间摸到水闸后一处干燥石台，台上放着一枚铜扣。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	冷水漫过鞋面，你被钟声震得心慌，没能找到落脚处。
	<<tiredness 3>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Blackiron Platform Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
你挑了两只干燥的樟木货箱之间坐下，听着水闸外平缓的暗渠流水声。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[起身回地下装卸台 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-blackiron-platform-rest-choices">
<<tendingicon>><<link "嗅着樟木清香调息 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-platform-rest-choices">>
<<if $willpower gte 460 or $skulduggery gte 280>>
淡淡的樟木清香掩去了地底的潮气，隐蔽的货箱死角让你安心地缓过劲来，<span class="green">体力恢复了不少。</span>
<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
水闸门的铜钟被暗浪冲得叮当乱响，像是有暗哨正在靠近，<span class="red">吓得你立刻绷紧身体站了起来。</span>
<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "扎紧松脱的鞋带 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-platform-rest-choices">>
你蹲在樟木货箱旁重新系紧鞋带，<span class="teal">淡淡的木香掩去了水闸的潮气。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Druid Circle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["druid_pillars"] to 1>>
穿过古木参天的深林迷雾，高大的风化花岗岩石柱在林间空地上围成一圈。苍翠的苔藓覆盖着脚下的腐殖土，空气中弥漫着清冽的松脂气息。
<<if $tending gte 260 or $willpower gte 450>>你顺着石柱上的螺旋符文辨清了林间方位。<<else>>浓重的林雾在巨石间流转，让人很难看清石环外围的去路。<</if>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>林冠间漏下清冷的星辉，石柱凹槽里的湿苔泛着极淡的银绿微光。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深林 (0:14)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 14>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[前往迷雾石柱群 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpMicroNotice and $mpMicroNotice["druid_conduit"]>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[去月泉石槽清松脂块 (0:04)|MP Region Micro Druid Conduit]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[辨认林间兽径 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Circle Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[向巡林猎手打听 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Circle Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Circle Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你拨开低垂的槲寄生，顺着石柱底座星辰刻痕与兽径搜寻。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回石环空地 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-druid-circle-scout">
<<investigateicon>><<link "顺着石柱刻痕摸索 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-druid-circle-scout">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>>你循着苔藓下的石板路往前探去，<span class="green">发现了通往月泉祭坛的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往古根地穴的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_watchtower"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往守林人瞭望台的路径。</span>
	<<else>>你把四周暗径复查了一遍，<span class="teal">没有新的异动。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	荆棘勾破了你的衣角与手背，<span class="red">只能先行退回。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link "攀上古橡树枝干 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-druid-circle-scout">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["druid_watchtower"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>>你攀上高枝透过浓雾看清了林间方位，<span class="green">锁定了守林人瞭望台的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了古根地穴的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了月泉祭坛的入口。</span>
	<<else>>高处视野开阔，<span class="teal">各处小径都已了然于胸。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	湿滑树皮让你脚下一滑差点摔落，<span class="red">没敢再往深处迈步。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Druid Circle Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
树根石台边坐着包扎猎犬的巡林猎手，你上前请教石环四周路径。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[告别猎手回石环 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-druid-circle-ask">
<<link "温和开口请教路径 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-druid-circle-ask">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>>猎手安抚好猎犬，抬手指了指雾中：<span class="green">告诉了你月泉祭坛的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你古根地穴的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_watchtower"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你守林人瞭望台的走法。</span>
	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说这儿的门道你已经全熟了。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	猎犬冲你低吠，猎手劝你趁早出林，<span class="red">让你碰了一鼻子灰。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "指认林间猎道记号 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-druid-circle-ask">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>>猎手见你认得阿什的巡山记号，点头告知：<span class="green">为你指明了古根地穴的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_watchtower"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了守林人瞭望台的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了月泉祭坛的暗径。</span>
	<<else>>对方冲你点点头，<span class="teal">提醒你里头一切照旧。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你认错了记号，猎手冷淡地摇了摇头，<span class="red">只让你老实在外头待着。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Druid Pillars [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["druid_pillars"] to 1>>
十二根高耸的风化花岗岩石柱在林间围成环阵，凹槽里的螺旋古符文在雨雾中泛着温润微光。两座主石柱之间拉着编满干枯槲寄生的麻绳。
<<if $history gte 260 or $tending gte 260>>你看出石柱排列暗合冬至月相的方位。<<else>>高大的巨石阵在浓雾里投下沉重的阴影。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿兽径退回石环口 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿水径去月泉 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Moonwell]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[垫脚够主石柱 (0:10)|MP Region Druid Pillars Search]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[靠正北主石柱歇脚 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Pillars Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看石柱影线 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-druid-pillars">>
<<if $history gte 260 or $tending gte 260>>
你发现正午影线落在两根挂槲寄生的石柱之间，影尖所指的浅草下有一条被踩实的引水小径。
<<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>>
<<else>>
林雾把石柱的影子揉成一团，你看了半天也定不准方向。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-druid-pillars"></div>
<br>
<<link [[扶起压住白藓的枯枝 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Pillars Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你垫高脚尖伸手探入正北主石柱的螺旋符文凹槽，摸索里面的青铜器物。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回迷雾石柱群 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="druid-pillars-choices">
<<investigateicon>><<link "抠符文凹槽 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#druid-pillars-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 330>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Druid_Pillars")>>
		你拨开卡住的石楔，取出一枚古德鲁伊青铜圣徽和一朵银丝花标本；凹槽深处还有一枚奉纳古银币。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragBrideFlower to ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_druid_pillars>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_druid_pillars to 1>>
			你在槲寄生麻绳系着的小皮囊里翻出两枚祈愿银币和一片刻着月相的石片。<span class="green">你把找到的物件妥善收好。</span>
			<<money 200>><<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">槲寄生麻绳下的小皮囊今日已被你查过，只剩几片干艾叶。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	石柱顶端的渡鸦旧巢受惊散落枯枝，粗糙花岗岩棱角刮破手指。你缩回手退下石台。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "读冬至刻痕 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#druid-pillars-choices">>
<<if $history gte 260 or $tending gte 260>>
	<<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>>
	你顺着冬至刻痕往下读，发现一组月相标记指向正北的月泉祭坛。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	苔藓盖住大半刻痕，你只认出两个重复的月相符号。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Druid Pillars Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
你背靠着正北主石柱干燥的背风面坐下，闭上眼睛呼吸着林间清冽的松脂雾气。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[起身回迷雾石柱群 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-druid-pillars-rest-choices">
<<tendingicon>><<link "背靠花岗岩壁避风 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-druid-pillars-rest-choices">>
<<if $willpower gte 430 or $tending gte 250>>
温润的花岗岩替你挡去了山风，草木与泥土的清香让你的呼吸渐渐平缓，<span class="green">一身疲乏消散了不少。</span>
<<tiredness -4>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
树冠上积聚的冰凉露水突然成串滴落进你的衣领，冻得你激灵灵打了个寒颤，<span class="red">半点睡意也没留下。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "抖掉肩头的松针 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-druid-pillars-rest-choices">>
你抖落肩头沾着的松针与露水，<span class="teal">靠着厚重的花岗岩柱缓匀了呼吸。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Druid Moonwell [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>>
终年不涸的林间冷泉汇聚在白石砌成的月牙池内，清澈的泉水从玉蝉雕刻的出水口潺潺流过。池边石案上摆着一只三足青铜爵。
<<if $tending gte 280 or $purity gte 500>>你看出泉眼四周盛开的正是罕见的双生银丝花。<<else>>微凉的水雾笼罩着白石池面，透着沁人心脾的寒意。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿石径退回石环口 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿细流去古根穴 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[跪到月泉池沿 (0:10)|MP Region Druid Moonwell Search]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[坐月泉白石畔小憩 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Moonwell Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看泉眼水纹 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-druid-moonwell">>
<<if $tending gte 280 or $purity gte 500>>
你发现泉眼有一缕细流绕过白石池沿，渗向东南那棵古橡树的根须；树根下有一道被水冲亮的缝。
<<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>>
<<else>>
冷雾贴着水面走，你只看见月牙池里自己的倒影。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-druid-moonwell"></div>
<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_druid_antler"]>><br><<keepsakeicon>><<link [[举起白鹿角符牌引路 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Region Druid Moonwell Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你挽起衣袖跪在月泉白石池沿，将手探进冰凉刺骨的泉眼石缝。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回月泉祭坛 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Moonwell]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="druid-moonwell-choices">
<<investigateicon>><<link "摸泉眼石缝 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#druid-moonwell-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 350>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Druid_Moonwell")>>
		你从泉眼石缝里捞出一只密封银匣，里面盛着月华玉佩和一朵双生银丝花标本；池底白砂间还有约 £3 的奉纳银币。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragBrideFlower to ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money 300>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_druid_moonwell>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_druid_moonwell to 1>>
			你在出水口白石槽下摸出两枚被泉水冲亮的古银币和一片刻着橡树叶的铜片。<span class="green">你把找到的物件妥善收好。</span>
			<<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">出水口白石槽下今日已被你摸过，只余下清冽的细白河砂。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	刺骨冷泉冻得五指发僵，脚下青苔一滑，险些栽进池中，手肘也磕在池沿。你只得退开。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "查三足爵铭文 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#druid-moonwell-choices">>
<<if $history gte 260 or $purity gte 450>>
	<<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>>
	你读出青铜爵腹部的奠酒短句，末尾提到“橡根之下，避雾之所”。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	铜锈把铭文咬得只剩几道浅痕，你读不成句。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

