:: MP Region Druid Rootcave [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>>
数棵千年古橡树盘根错节，在地底围拢成一座天然的干燥洞穴。粗壮的苍白根须交汇处包裹着一颗散发微光的萤石球，石台上摆着五只陶瓮。
<<if $tending gte 280 or $science gte 260>>你闻出陶瓮泥封里透出的是安神草药的香气。<<else>>盘结的树根如穹顶般笼罩头顶，空气温暖而幽暗。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿根缝退回石环口 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿藤梯上瞭望台 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[蹲到药草石臼前 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Rootcave Search]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[坐古树干苔垫养神 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Rootcave Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "闻陶瓮药香 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-druid-rootcave">>
<<if $tending gte 280 or $science gte 260>>
你辨出五只陶瓮里混着安神草和松脂，最里侧瓮底压着一小截藤梯绳头，绳头通向林冠瞭望台。
<<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>>
<<else>>
苦草药味太浓，你只闻出其中两味，没找到绳头。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-druid-rootcave"></div>

