	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说这儿的门道你已经全熟了。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	侍者礼貌却坚决地拦下了你的话头，<span class="red">让你碰了一鼻子灰。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "亮出暗层贵宾切口 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-velvet-mirage-ask">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["velvet_terrace"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] to 1>>侍者听出暗层切口，低声为你引路：<span class="green">为你指明了露台观海雅座的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["velvet_auction"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_auction"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了私人拍卖暗厅的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["velvet_salon"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_salon"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了镜面试衣沙龙的暗径。</span>
	<<else>>对方冲你点点头，<span class="teal">提醒你里头一切照旧。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
