<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Velvet Masque [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_masque"] to 1>>
长廊两侧的暗红壁龛里陈列着十二副威尼斯金银雕花假面，往来宾客皆以面具遮面。远处隐约传来大提琴低柔的弦音，胡桃木衣帽架立在回廊尽头。
<<if $danceskill gte 260 or $seductionskill gte 260>>你踏着弦乐节拍从容走过壁龛，姿态没有露出丝毫破绽。<<else>>银狐假面空洞的眼眶在壁灯下闪着微光，令人有些紧张。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿回廊退回天鹅绒口 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["velvet_salon"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[掀丝绒帘去沙龙 (0:06)|MP Region Velvet Salon]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[走近银狐壁龛 (0:09)|MP Region Velvet Masque Search]]>><<pass 9>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[坐回廊丝绒凳小憩 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Masque Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看面具眼孔 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-velvet-masque">>
<<if $danceskill gte 260 or $seductionskill gte 260>>
你发现银狐假面右侧眼孔有一圈新磨出的亮痕，壁龛后的丝绒帘比别处薄，透出试衣镜的反光。
<<set $mpKnown["velvet_salon"] to 1>>
<<else>>
壁灯把十二副假面照得一模一样，你只看见一片空洞的眼眶。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-velvet-masque"></div>
<br>
<<link [[端详壁龛松脱的孔雀羽面具 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

