<<if $willpower gte 460 or $danceskill gte 260>>
银炭散发的融融暖意烘热了你的肩头，<span class="green">远处的海浪声将你的思绪洗涤得格外平静。</span>
<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
峭壁栈道铁门上的黄铜锁链被海风吹得哗啦乱撞，悬空的眩晕感让你手心出汗，<span class="red">怎么也坐不安稳。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拢紧被海风吹散的发 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-velvet-terrace-rest-choices">>
你凑在银炭火盆边拢好被海风吹散的头发，<span class="teal">暖意顺着指尖传遍全身。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Velvet Auction [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_auction"] to 1>>
设在暗层最深处的环形阶梯暗厅空无一人，正中央的紫檀展台上扣着黑丝绒罩布。二楼的贵宾包厢垂着双层金线纱帘，记账桌设在后台侧门旁。
<<if $skulduggery gte 300 or $history gte 280>>你一眼看出了紫檀展台下方的传菜暗梯机关。<<else>>空旷肃穆的环形暗厅里静得连呼吸声都清晰可闻。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿环形梯退回天鹅绒口 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[走上紫檀展台 (0:14)|MP Region Velvet Auction Search]]>><<pass 14>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[进二楼包厢内小憩 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Auction Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看传菜暗梯 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-velvet-auction">>
<<if $skulduggery gte 300 or $history gte 280>>
你发现展台下方的传菜暗梯口有一道新擦痕，旁边的铜铃线被一根头发丝缠住，显然有人常从这里上下。
<<else>>
环形暗厅静得能听见呼吸，你只看见罩布在空调风里轻轻起伏。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-velvet-auction"></div>
<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_velvet_mask"]>><br><<keepsakeicon>><<link [[戴上银狐假面入后台 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Region Velvet Auction Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你走上环形暗厅中央的紫檀展台，掀开黑丝绒罩布一角摸索底部的铜簧暗格。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回拍卖暗厅 (0:02)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="velvet-auction-choices">
<<investigateicon>><<link "掀展台罩布 (0:14)">><<pass 14>><<replace "#velvet-auction-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 430>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Velvet_Auction")>>
		铜簧轻响弹开，你取出一件未交割的传世古物和一枚暗金假面徽章；红木匣里还码着约 £5 的高额筹码。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragVelvetCrest or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragVelvetCrest to ($mpFragVelvetCrest or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money 500>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_velvet_auction>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_velvet_auction to 1>>
			你在后台记账桌的象牙算盘下摸出两枚保证金银币和一张写着买家缩写的底价单。<span class="green">你把找到的物件妥善收好。</span>
			<<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">记账桌象牙算盘下今日已被你翻过，只余下几滴干涸红蜡。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	展台下的配重铜铃突然被碰响，后台走廊传来执事询问的脚步声。你慌忙放下罩布退入暗影。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "翻后台记账桌 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#velvet-auction-choices">>
<<if $maths gte 240 or $history gte 240>>
	你在账册夹页里找到一个买家的缩写和一枚火漆印，印面和壁龛里的假面徽章一模一样。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	算盘珠散了一地，你只顾去捡，没看清账页上的字。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

