:: MP Region Observatory Wing [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_dome"] to 1>>
穿过图书馆古籍架后的木制暗门，你踏入了学园早年封存的旧天文翼楼。半球形木拱廊下陈列着落满灰尘的黄铜浑天仪，空气中弥漫着樟木与旧书卷的气息。
<<if $science gte 260 or $maths gte 260>>你借着高窗透入的微光看清了廊柱上的导览铜牌。<<else>>封存多年的旧翼楼空旷幽静，每走一步木地板都会发出轻响。<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨点敲打着高处的弧形采光天窗，将整座旧翼楼衬得愈发幽深。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学院图书馆 (0:06)|School Library]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<pass 6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[前往折光穹顶室 (0:05)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查看旋梯痕迹 (0:06)|MP Region Observatory Wing Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[向值日学长打听 (0:05)|MP Region Observatory Wing Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Region Observatory Wing Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你凑到走廊黄铜平面图前，拂去浮灰辨认旧翼楼各处通道。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回翼楼门廊 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-observatory-wing-scout">
<<investigateicon>><<link "探查绒布帘后暗门 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-wing-scout">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["observatory_star"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_star"] to 1>>你在书架夹缝后摸到了铜门把手，<span class="green">发现了通往星图档案室的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往标本陈列暗阁的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_bridge"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往钟楼连廊的路径。</span>
	<<else>>你把四周暗径复查了一遍，<span class="teal">没有新的异动。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	落灰呛得你打了个喷嚏，<span class="red">只能先行退回。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link "顺螺旋铁梯向上探看 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-wing-scout">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["observatory_bridge"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>>你登上铁梯半层看清了拱廊走向，<span class="green">锁定了钟楼连廊的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了标本陈列暗阁的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_star"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_star"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了星图档案室的入口。</span>
	<<else>>高处视野开阔，<span class="teal">各处小径都已了然于胸。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	旧铁梯发出吱呀长鸣惊动了值日生，<span class="red">没敢再往深处迈步。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Observatory Wing Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
暗门连廊旁站着核对编号的值日图书员，你上前询问旧翼楼分布。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回去 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-observatory-wing-ask">
<<link "轻声询问翼楼格局 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-wing-ask">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["observatory_star"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_star"] to 1>>图书员推了推眼镜，指了指走廊内侧：<span class="green">告诉了你星图档案室的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你标本陈列暗阁的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_bridge"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你钟楼连廊的走法。</span>
	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说这儿的门道你已经全熟了。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	图书员合上登记簿让你别往封存区走，<span class="red">让你碰了一鼻子灰。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "提起星图检索编号 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-wing-ask">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>>图书员见你熟悉旧档编号，小声告知：<span class="green">为你指明了标本陈列暗阁的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_bridge"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了钟楼连廊的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_star"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_star"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了星图档案室的暗径。</span>
	<<else>>对方冲你点点头，<span class="teal">提醒你里头一切照旧。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你报出的索引号不对，图书员摇了摇头，<span class="red">只让你老实在外头待着。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Observatory Dome [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_dome"] to 1>>
可以开启天窗的半球形主厅中央，架设着一具巨型黄铜赤道仪与折光望远镜。地面铺着环形旋转滑轨，目镜下方放着厚重的观测记录簿。
<<if $science gte 280 or $maths gte 280>>你一眼看懂了赤道仪配重箱与赤纬刻度盘的平衡结构。<<else>>庞大的黄铜望远镜直指穹顶天窗，透着精密而森严的气息。<</if>>
