:: MP Region Observatory Star [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_star"] to 1>>
高达天花板的樟木画筒架占满了整间档案室，铜管里收藏着近百年来的雾月潮汐记录与古星图。中央的绘图斜桌上铺着半张月相蚀变图。
<<if $history gte 280 or $maths gte 260>>你顺着年份标签看去，一眼锁定了最早的『1894』号铜画筒。<<else>>成百上千只铜管画筒密密麻麻，看得人眼花缭乱。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿木廊退回翼楼口 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[穿侧门去陈列阁 (0:07)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[踩上木踏脚凳 (0:12)|MP Region Observatory Star Search]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[靠樟木画筒架小憩 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Star Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看画筒编号 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-observatory-star">>
<<if $history gte 280 or $maths gte 260>>
你发现画筒架在 1893 与 1895 之间空出一格，空档后方的墙板上有一道新擦痕，通向标本陈列阁。
<<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>>
<<else>>
成百上千只铜管在暗处泛着同样的光，你看得眼花。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-observatory-star"></div>
<br>
<<link [[查看松脱销钉的铜地球仪 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Observatory Star Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你踩上木踏脚凳，伸手去拧画筒架最底层『1894』号黄铜画筒的螺纹封盖。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回星图档案室 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="observatory-star-choices">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拧画筒封盖 (0:12)">><<pass 12>><<replace "#observatory-star-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 360>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Observatory_Star")>>
		封盖顺畅旋开，你倒出一卷孤儿院早年星象密档和半枚王冠齿轮残片；筒底绒布包里还有约 £3 的档案保管金。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money 300>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_observatory_star>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_observatory_star to 1>>
			你在地球仪支架下的皮面笔记本夹层里翻出两枚旧书券和一张标着“陈列阁”的索书条。<span class="green">你把找到的物件妥善收好。</span>
			<<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">地球仪下的笔记本夹层今日已被你翻过，只余下旧纸气息。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	画筒封盖锈得极死，上方架子一只空铜筒滚落下来砸在额角。你捂着额头退下踏脚凳。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "查月相蚀变图 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#observatory-star-choices">>
<<if $history gte 280 or $maths gte 260>>
	<<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>>
	你从月相蚀变图的边缘读出一组日期，和标本陈列阁门牌上的收藏年份完全吻合。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	图纸受潮起皱，你算到一半便对不上刻度。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Observatory Star Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
你靠在弥漫着樟木清香的画筒架旁坐下，合上眼帘静听窗外的微风。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先退回去 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-observatory-star-rest-choices">
<<tendingicon>><<link "嗅着书卷樟香静心 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-star-rest-choices">>
<<if $history gte 250 or $willpower gte 440>>
温和醇正的书卷气与樟木香驱散了你心头的浮躁，<span class="green">安静的档案室让你很快恢复了充沛的精力。</span>
<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
角落那台缩微胶片阅读机的散热风扇突然嗡嗡作响，待机红灯在暗处不停闪烁，<span class="red">晃得你心烦意乱。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拂平衣摆上的折痕 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-star-rest-choices">>
你拂平衣摆上的折痕靠着画筒架坐下，<span class="teal">醇正的樟木书香令人心境澄明。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Observatory Cabinet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>>
内侧暗阁的玻璃展柜里陈列着早期自然科学标本、紫水晶簇与光学棱镜。东壁挂着一幅古生物化石石板，夜光萤石在暗处散发出柔和的浅绿微光。
<<if $science gte 280 or $history gte 260>>你注意到最底层紫水晶簇的木底座留有合页缝隙。<<else>>形态各异的化石与矿石晶簇在幽暗中显得格外冷峻。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿暗阁退回翼楼口 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"]>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿侧廊去钟塔连廊 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Bridge]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[蹲到最底层展柜 (0:11)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet Search]]>><<pass 11>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[坐萤石展柜旁养神 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看底座合页 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-observatory-cabinet">>
<<if $science gte 280 or $history gte 260>>
你注意到紫水晶簇的木底座有一道合页缝，旁边地面有一串从钟楼连廊方向来的新鲜鞋印。
<<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>>
<<else>>
萤石绿光把展柜照得冷幽幽的，你只看见一片晶簇的反光。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-observatory-cabinet"></div>

:: MP Region Observatory Cabinet Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你蹲在玻璃展柜最底层，用铜镊子去拨紫水晶簇空心底座的内侧卡簧。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回标本陈列阁 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="observatory-cabinet-choices">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拨水晶底座 (0:11)">><<pass 11>><<replace "#observatory-cabinet-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 370>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Observatory_Cabinet")>>
		底座暗格弹开，你翻出一枚旧港走私王火漆印戒、一块古矿石标本和半枚王冠齿轮残片；里面还垫着一枚收藏金币。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money 400>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_observatory_cabinet>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_observatory_cabinet to 1>>
			你在旋转玻璃架的海螺化石螺口里摸出两枚绒布包裹的旧银币和一张写着“钟楼连廊”的标签。<span class="green">你把找到的物件妥善收好。</span>
			<<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">海螺化石螺口今日已被你探过，只剩一层细微的钙质白粉。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	锋利的水晶棱角划破指腹，镊子也在玻璃柜壁上磕出脆响。你连忙缩手合上柜门。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "查化石石板铭牌 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#observatory-cabinet-choices">>
<<if $science gte 280 or $history gte 260>>
	<<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>>
	你读出一块化石石板的捐赠铭牌，末尾提到“钟楼连廊风速计”，字迹和展柜标签同源。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	铭牌被地衣糊住，你只认出半个姓氏。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Observatory Cabinet Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
你坐在夜光萤石展柜旁的木凳上，沐浴着温润的浅绿色矿石微光静心调息。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[起身回标本陈列阁 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-observatory-cabinet-rest-choices">
<<tendingicon>><<link "沐浴浅绿微光调息 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-cabinet-rest-choices">>
<<if $science gte 250 or $willpower gte 450>>
静谧的暗阁与柔和的萤石荧光抚平了你紧绷的思绪，<span class="green">你靠着展柜安稳地歇过了乏味与疲倦。</span>
<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
角落药水柜底层的福尔马林气味顺着柜缝渗出来，熏得你眼眶发涩、鼻腔刺痛，<span class="red">根本坐不住。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "搓热微凉的指尖 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-cabinet-rest-choices">>
你在浅绿色的萤石微光里搓热指尖，<span class="teal">幽暗安静的陈列阁抚平了倦意。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Observatory Bridge [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>>
架设在屋顶飞扶壁之间的石砌拱廊装有防风百叶窗，透过拱券可直接眺望近在咫尺的学园钟塔。西侧壁龛里立着一座铜制风速计，风杯缓缓旋转。
<<if $athletics gte 260 or $willpower gte 450>>你稳步走在宽阔的拱窗石台边，俯瞰整座学园的青石屋顶。<<else>>高处穿堂而过的风声在飞扶壁间呼啸，让人有些心悸。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿石阶退回翼楼口 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[探身靠近石兽 (0:11)|MP Region Observatory Bridge Search]]>><<pass 11>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[坐拱窗石台上歇脚 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Bridge Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看风速计轴承 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-observatory-bridge">>
<<if $athletics gte 260 or $science gte 240>>
你发现风速计轴承上油过多，旁边石兽背部有一道被反复摸过的浅槽，槽里卡着一小片铁皮。
<<else>>
高处风声呼啸，你只顾扶稳石栏，没细看风速计。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-observatory-bridge"></div>

:: MP Region Observatory Bridge Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你探身凑近钟楼连廊拱窗内侧的排水石兽，伸手摸向石兽背部的凹槽。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回钟楼连廊 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Bridge]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="observatory-bridge-choices">
<<investigateicon>><<link "探石兽凹槽 (0:11)">><<pass 11>><<replace "#observatory-bridge-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 350>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Observatory_Bridge")>>
		你勾出卡在石兽凹槽里的铁皮盒，取得半枚王冠黄铜齿轮和一只古董怀表；盒底还压着一枚钟楼修缮银币。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
		<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_observatory_bridge>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_observatory_bridge to 1>>
			你在风速计底座下的小皮匣里摸出两枚高年级学生藏起的银币和一张写着“连廊检修”的工单。<span class="green">你把找到的物件妥善收好。</span>
			<<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">风速计底座下的小皮匣今日已被你翻过，只剩两枚旧铁垫圈。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	风速计旋转铜杯刮到手背，拱窗外寒风又吹得你重心不稳。你急忙缩回身子扶住石柱。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "读修缮铭牌 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#observatory-bridge-choices">>
<<if $history gte 240 or $maths gte 240>>
	你在连廊石柱上找到一块修缮铭牌，背面记着钟楼报时和一段“西侧石兽”的检修备注。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	铭牌字迹被风雨蚀平，你只认出年份。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Observatory Bridge Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
你合上连廊迎风侧的木百叶窗，坐在宽阔干燥的拱窗石台上缓了口气。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[起身回钟楼连廊 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Bridge]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-observatory-bridge-rest-choices">
<<tendingicon>><<link "合上迎风百叶静坐 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-bridge-rest-choices">>
<<if $willpower gte 440 or $athletics gte 260>>
温和的穿堂微风拂过脸颊，<span class="green">俯瞰学园屋顶的幽静景致让你紧绷的身心彻底放松下来。</span>
<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
不远处的学园钟塔突然敲响整点铜钟，浑厚的钟声在连廊拱顶间剧烈共鸣，<span class="red">震得你耳膜嗡嗡作响。</span>
<<stress 4>><<pain 1>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "扣紧防风的袖口 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-bridge-rest-choices">>
你扣紧袖口坐在宽阔干燥的拱窗石台上，<span class="teal">平缓的呼吸让体力渐渐回升。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

